	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r1202_mountain_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ビルから　まちを　みおろす……
そうすると　ふるえるよ▼
だって　わがはい
たかいところ　こわいもん……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ビルから　街を　みおろす……
そうすると　震えるよ▼
だって　我輩
高所恐怖症　だもん……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ調整</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T03:32:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MOUNTAIN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
